            "notes": "### \ud83d\udcab POWERS\n\n| Power | Description |\n| ------ | ------------ |\n| [Face Tanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea) | Great Power for Survivability; It will synergize really well when we get [Singijeon\u2019s Pulse Plating](item_033e4839-b8cb-49bf-ac8c-172bfce6d06f) and [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) later on |\n| &nbsp; | &nbsp; |\n\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f ITEMS\n\n#### Why not [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) or [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) in the beginning?\nI think a very low amount (5%) of Weapon Power or Attack Speed won't do much for D.Va's primary fire by itself. I personally prefer going for a 10% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), and 10% [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) can be beneficial when paired with [Facetanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea).\n\n| Item | Description |\n| ---- | ------------ |\n| [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  | [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) (5%) |\n| [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7)  | [Ability Lifesteal](stat_ability_lifesteal) (10%) |\n| [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) | [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) (10%) |\n| &nbsp; | &nbsp; |",
